/Title (The application was built in Zoho Creator by first setting up a blank application workspace, then designing the registration form with suitable field types, adding validation and mandatory rules, deploying the form as a live application, testing it with sample data, and finally verifying the stored records in the underlying database. The overall data model connecting all forms was then documented as an Entity-Relationship \(ER\) diagram. Each step is described below with its corresponding screenshot.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 163 0 R
>>
